  "text": "proprium.ascensio-domini-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Ascension of the Lord” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Grant, we beseech Thee, almighty and merciful God, that we may obtain by invisible effect what we have received under visible mysteries. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
